sequenceDiagram
    participant FE
    participant API as everfit-api
    participant Q as Kue queue
    participant DB as MongoDB

    FE->>API: GET get-list-autoflow-body-metric
    API-->>FE: full catalog, Autoflow's default metrics marked selected

    opt Manage Metric, create a metric not in the catalog
        FE->>API: POST add-new-metric
        API-->>FE: new metric
    end

    FE->>API: PUT autoflow-interval-task update-task, with metrics
    API->>DB: updateTask, set metrics on the template
    API->>Q: enqueue fan-out job, one per enrolled client

    loop each enrolled client
        alt not completed this occurrence
            Q->>DB: resync client instance from template, metrics included
        else already completed
            Q->>DB: skip, client keeps original metrics and order
        end
    end
